---
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  heading="Terms of Use"
  updated={site.legalUpdated}
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms for using ToolKade's free online tools and calculators, including acceptable use, accuracy of results, intellectual property and liability limits."
>
  <p>
    By using {site.name} ({site.url}) you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the
    site.
  </p>

  <h2>Using our tools</h2>
  <p>
    Our tools are free for personal and commercial use. You may not use the site in a way that harms it or
    other users, for example by trying to break its security, overloading it with automated requests, or
    copying the site in bulk.
  </p>

  <h2>Results are estimates</h2>
  <p>
    Calculators and converters give estimates based on the information you enter and the rates available to us
    when they were last updated. Laws, tax brackets, duty rates and tariffs change. Results are not
    professional, financial, tax or legal advice. Always confirm important figures with the relevant authority
    or a qualified professional. See our <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Your content</h2>
  <p>
    Files and text you use with our tools are processed in your browser and are not uploaded to us. You are
    responsible for having the right to use any content you process.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The site's design, code, text and logos belong to {site.name}. You may link to any page. Please do not
    copy our articles or tools without permission.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    The site is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind. We work to keep it accurate and available,
    but we do not guarantee that it will be error-free or always online.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent the law allows, {site.name} is not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of
    the site or reliance on its results.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party links and ads</h2>
  <p>
    The site may link to other websites and show ads from third parties. We are not responsible for their
    content or practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top shows when they last changed. Continued
    use of the site means you accept the updated terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms? Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
